<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/67cb59e9-cb7c-4ea6-b841-c1deadad8ad2> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "This course is based on the \"Basic Course\" offer of the KIM Open Science Center of the University of Konstanz. It offers a collection of seven modules aiming at research and training related aspects around Open Science, like Policies and Strategies, Research Data Management and perspectives across ERUA countries and Planning Data Management, Models and Publishing, Citizen Science, Legal Aspects and Alternative Measures of Research Impact in the context of Open Science and Open Educational Resources." ;
