<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/8477f8de-a6c6-416c-bda7-2936dacad5ff> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "The self-study course offers an introduction to Jupyter Notebooks. Thematically it starts with the installation of the Software, teaches first operations with the system and eventually shines a light on advanced use cases, like the transformation from Python code into Jupyter Notebooks. Furthermore it offers informations on how to use Jupyter Notebooks in Teaching." ;
