<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/84e64329-43d9-4e0b-a1c5-0bd0c92d1133> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "The online course offers a good overview of the topics mentioned in the title, especially regarding the programming language R, the IIIF standard and Mirador, Git and GitHub, Regular Expressions (RE) and the graph databases SPARQL. For each topic block, text sections with subject-specific examples, concrete quizzes, explanatory videos and application areas have been compiled. Furthermore, at the end of each section, links to further information and tutorials are listed, which offer the user the opportunity to deepen their knowledge individually." ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-3/deu> ;
