<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/f67d0988-eca7-4607-acd8-48e8414e5018> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "The instructional videos from RWTH Aachen offer a good first introduction to the topic of FDM. The offer is generic and covers the basics of good FDM in six videos (<10 minutes). The videos are linked by a narrative thread based on an example, but each video is stand-alone and can be understood without viewing previous videos." ;
